# Minimal vehicle collision mesh — side faces only, no top/bottom caps
# 1.8m wide x 4.0m long x 1.5m tall box at Y=0
# 8 vertices, 4 side faces (8 triangles), pivot at Y=0 base-center
# Authored per architecture/asset-standards/3d-model-standards.md
# Constraint: vehicle _col.obj 8 tris, side-faces only, Y=0
o vehicle_col
v -0.9  0.0 -2.0
v  0.9  0.0 -2.0
v  0.9  0.0  2.0
v -0.9  0.0  2.0
v -0.9  1.5 -2.0
v  0.9  1.5 -2.0
v  0.9  1.5  2.0
v -0.9  1.5  2.0
# South face (-Z side)
f 1 2 6
f 1 6 5
# East face (+X side)
f 2 3 7
f 2 7 6
# North face (+Z side)
f 3 4 8
f 3 8 7
# West face (-X side)
f 4 1 5
f 4 5 8
